  "description": "Jacqueline Somerset found herself penniless overnight following her father’s death and the family’s bankruptcy. She is hired as the thirteenth governess at Preston Manor. Amid a tense relationship with the marquis, who is notorious for his demanding nature, she goes beyond mere survival to uncover his hidden secrets, and gradually begins to grow closer to him…\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
